{'symbol': 'KDP', 'date': '2021-10-01 07:00:00', 'title': 'KEURIG DR PEPPER ANNOUNCES NEW SHARE REPURCHASE AUTHORIZATION', 'text': 'BURLINGTON, MASS. AND FRISCO, TEXAS, OCT. 1, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0KEURIG DR PEPPER INC. (NASDAQ: KDP) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS AUTHORIZED A SHARE REPURCHASE PROGRAM OF UP TO $4 BILLION OF THE COMPANY\'S OUTSTANDING COMMON STOCK ("SHARES"), ENABLING THE COMPANY TO OPPORTUNISTICALLY RETURN VALUE TO SHAREHOLDERS.'}